{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_09_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_09",
  "title": "Mouse's Courage, Dragon's Might",
  "storyCode": "DH-9",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "885e45171682c12798f2fa5d261f2c99d4331924caaf67660786c023bf5e0fdc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, look. That's Ch'en and Lin they're chasing, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Impressive. Really impressive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We should go help—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Suddenly, a loud explosion echoes from the ship, not far from the shore."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What did you do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A little surprise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Remember how I asked you what to do after the hostages are rescued?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I did agree with you that I should take everyone with me and leave, but then it came to me I still had that bomb."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So I thought I'd give them a little surprise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Care for a drink?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Interesting time for such a display of aesthetics."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I didn't notice this until I got the boat out here. Figured I'd try my hand at arranging it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sounds lame."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Talking about yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't tell for sure whether you did that intentionally or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Have you forgotten already? 'When it comes time for you to take over, you can't always do as they did in the past.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The call was still connected when you said that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, be straight with me. You didn't do what I think you did, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're almost to the shore."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You lost, old man."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have no idea what you've done, helping Candela."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've done well, Pancho."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Captain's Subordinate",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_193",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Candela!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop. We lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come, sit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you trying to do, Candela?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can't you tell? I'm inviting you to eat with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pancho snorts, but sits down opposite to Candela nonetheless."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Most men would be terrified at this point. That's what I like about you, Pancho."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You flatter me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I lost, but not only have you not arrested me, you're asking me out to eat. What are you trying to do? Humiliate me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want a chat, Pancho."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You used Ernesto to distract me, and you had your underlings plant bombs all over the city during the competition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Finally, right before the third round was to begin, you took all the elites and dignitaries on the ship hostage to keep me from doing anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've got to hand it to you, Pancho. This is the closest I've come to losing my city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Concha tu madre, Candela. My men and I spent days on end to put this plan in motion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then, it so happens you invited two outsiders who don't know the slightest thing about this city here, and it so happens they took on this case for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And they... They happen to thwart my plans!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why did you, of all people, win?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I won?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you talking about? Dear Pancho, I think you've spent so much time in my city that you've forgotten who I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Or perhaps you never understood me at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was never your opponent, and you didn't lose to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You merely failed. It's that simple."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You lived in the city you despise the most for decades, complaining about the three governments, yet you accepted the backing of one of them just to overthrow me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let me guess. It's probably someone from the Leithanian side. Oh, I even have a good idea who it might be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tell me, Pancho. What was going on in your mind that you turned to those ruthless men for help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, so you've learned to swallow your pride."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In that case, why not wag your tail at me and beg for my mercy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How are you so sure I wouldn't help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I mean it, Pancho. If you had come begging, perhaps I would've given you the manpower and money to fight the wars you so love."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And if you then managed to win, this city would have to bow down to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You couldn't find a more attractive plan if you tried."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will never bow down to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, look at you. You're always so stubborn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Men like you always have unrealistic expectations of the words 'complete' and 'independence'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You dream of an ideology that will bring all of you together. You seek a symbol that will unite all of you under its banner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the truth is Bolívar has never been independent. It has no history, so where will you find your ideology and symbol?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Suppose you succeeded, would the Bolívar you go on to forge really be the Bolívar you've always dreamt of? Somehow I doubt it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It doesn't matter what you say. All I've ever wanted is an end to the war, for peace to be restored to Bolívar."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I lost. I accept defeat, Candela."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My undertaking may not be righteous, but, at the very least, I am more righteous than you are!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, pardon. Look at me, I confused you with the men behind you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You are not the kind of man I described. You wish to save this country from the bottom of your heart, and that earned you this seat right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "However, you must be punished for your failure, so I will treat you as their leader nonetheless. Makes things easier that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've never thought myself righteous, dear old Pancho."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't care what the three governments are doing, and I certainly don't care about your Bolívar."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You say I'm obsessed with this city, but you're wrong. I don't care about this city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What I care about is the meaning that this city represents."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pancho",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_192_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Meaning? You call wasting your life away on entertainment meaning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Sigh*, look at how stubborn you are. You will never understand what money represents."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay, take this old bastard away. I will talk to him some other time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you come across anyone trying to resist, you know what to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bodyguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_207",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, ma'am."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow, I bet not even the Hung-mên Banquet was this intense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just watching them was enough to give me creeps."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That was about as suffocating to watch as watching my father and grandpa having dinner together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Agreed."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hoshiguma?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_196_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Swire?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look at you two. You're drenched. Get a towel and dry yourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you doing here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hahaha, it's a long story. We'll talk about it over dinner."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Swire",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_197_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Eh, I'm not sure I'm in the mood for dinner after all this."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, my girls, look at me chattering away with Pancho, leaving my heroes of the day out in the cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, you over there, get two drones over here right now. Lighting, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That was beautiful from the two of you. Simply beautiful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have to thank Wei Yenwu for introducing me to such fine examples of the younger generation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And you contributed a wonderful, unparalleled ending to this championship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Championship? Ending?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right. If nothing goes wrong, I am guessing a lot of people are sitting in front of their TVs, watching us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Although we didn't get footage of everything that transpired inside the ship, I am sure the sight of you taking on Pancho on the deck has left a deep impression."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone must be cheering for you two right about now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You once told me that as long as you're here, no one can threaten this city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, I did. What of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't consider everything that just happened a threat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hahaha, my little Ch'en, you are still far too young."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What constitutes a threat? Is it the city getting leveled? Is it seeing its entire population massacred?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, those are hardly threats, Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The real threat is the city's people losing their desires, never to seek enjoyment again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But you've been a policewoman for a great number of years. Do you think that's possible?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, the look on your face tells me what you think."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You see. You know it yourself. The answer is that it's not possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And as long as that remains the answer, this city will continue to exist. And if Dossoles falls, Tressoles will rise in its place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "However many cities you need, I can build."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nonetheless, that doesn't erase the fact that you two are heroes to this city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, look at me. How forgetful I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is the party ready yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bodyguard",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_207",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "For the most part."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now where's my mic... Oh, there we are."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ahem, my dear citizens and tourists. Whether you are sitting in front of a TV or watching from the beach..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It gives me great pleasure to announce to you the final victors of this year's Dossoles Warrior Champion, as well as the heroes that saved our city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our heroines from Lungmen—Ch'en Hui-chieh and Lin Yühsia!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let us also thank Pancho for taking it upon himself to give us such a grand performance!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Candela",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, we'll be throwing a party on the beach. Everyone is welcome!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
